# A legendary Pokémon wakes (Emerald's MUS_AWAKEN_LEGEND): a slow swell from a low rumble of timpani and brass to a
# great held chord in C minor, ringing out over the choir. Plays once, under the scene that calls it; the scene then
# brings back the music of the place. Original composition for this game (plan 21 · H7, part b).
title A Legend Awakens
tempo 72
meter 4/4
reverb 0.5

